OL,3,GNEWSAKing's Award charity recognition
OL,4,A'overwhelming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen charities, social
OL,7,Fenterprises and community groups across
OL,8,Fthe north-east of England and Cumbria
OL,9,Fhave been given the King's Award for
OL,10,FVoluntary Service.
OL,12,FThe award is the highest given to
OL,13,Fvolunteer groups across the UK - the
OL,14,Fcharity equivalent of an MBE - and was
OL,15,Fannounced to mark King Charles'
OL,16,Fbirthday on 14 November.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
