OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKing's Award charity recognition
OL,4,A'overwhelming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the region's 16 recipients was
OL,7,FFeeding Families, which supports
OL,8,Fthousands of people facing food poverty
OL,9,For who are in crisis. CEO, Wayne
OL,10,FDobson, said the organisation was
OL,11,F"overwhelmed" by the news.
OL,13,FLynsey Buckle, who holds the same role
OL,14,Fat Cumbria Family Support which worked
OL,15,Fwith 255 families last year, said: "We
OL,16,Fare over the moon."
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
